	<h3><u>ek aabid ek shabbir</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><big>arshaan tay farshaan tay<br>duniya tay ena warga<br>koyi nahin<br>do saabir nay kainaat andar ek aabid ek shabbir ay<br>ek bhenrhaan saamrhnain qatl hoya <br>ek behnrhaan naal aseer ay<br><br>ek laashaa chuk kay asghar da<br>kar nabiyaan noon hairaan gaya<br>ek chuk kay laash sakina di<br>utay labda qabrustaan gaya<br>barhi mushkil naal ay dafn keetay <br>ek puttar tay ek hamsheer ay<br><br>do saabir nay kainaat andar ek aabid ek shabbir ay<br><br>kainaat ich doon piyo putraan di<br>nain milrhin hor misaal ay<br>ek saamnrhnay bhainrh day qatl hoya <br>ek qaidi bhenrh day naal ay<br>ek roya nok te naizay di<br>tak bhainrh day khhulay huway waal ay<br>ek bhainrh yateem di ghurbat tay<br>rat roya chaalee saal ay<br><br>ek naizay tay gham karda ay<br>zainab di parda daari da<br>karbal ton lay kay sham taen<br>nain rukda khoon muhaari da<br>dowan piyo putraan nay wekhi ay <br>dukhi zainab di tashheer ay<br><br>do saabir nay kainaat andar ek aabid ek shabbir ay<br><br>mazloom hussain noon karbal wich<br>chup ghazi veer di khaagayi ay<br>baazaaraan tay darbaaraan wich<br>sajjad noon khoon ruwa gayi ay<br>o burqay mangdi shamiyaan ton <br>jiday ghar utri tatheer ay<br><br>do saabir nay kainaat andar ek aabid ek shabbir ay<br><br>shabbir nay karbal wich logo<br>haey laashay bahattar chaey nay<br>sir naizay wekh bahattar day<br>aabid noon ghash wi aaey nay<br>dowaan sabiraan nay lutdi wekhi <br>enj zahra di jaageer ay<br><br>do saabir nay kainaat andar ek aabid ek shabbir ay<br><br>islam noon ""hassan"" bachawanrh layi<br>shabbir nay sab kuj waar dita<br>kuj zakhmi baal tay phuphiyaan naal<br>mazloom sajjad jehaad kita<br>khulay hath shabbir di fauj day san <br>sajjad di fauj aseer ay<br><br>do saabir nay kainaat andar ek aabid ek shabbir ay</big></p>
               
                
